# App rules

- Stack: **Avalonia 11 + .NET 8 + C#** — new UI from scratch
- Business logic in `DrumDuino.Core`; UI in `DrumDuino.App`
- Do not copy or port old ConfigTool (C#/Python/.exe) UI or code
- Serial: 115200 COM, Tool mode on connect, MIDI mode on disconnect/exit
- Presets: JSON primary; `pins.ini` import only (legacy data format)
- Keep Mega 16 pad profile; no 48-pad UI unless firmware changes first
- Match existing dark, simple layout patterns in `MainWindow.axaml`
